invariant: INV-16
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul
reason: the client derives its x25519 share under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED
  whatever it answered. The share is the same.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h counts the client's calls around
  its own and requires a client that answers CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME to
  call no file under its own names.

--- old
    widemul_x25519_base(widemul_answer(&t->cfg), h->pub, h->priv);
--- new
    widemul_x25519_base(CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, h->pub, h->priv);
